WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,370
It's a new order for you

2
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,030
I will keep it well

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,240
Waiting for the day when the new house is built

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,240
I did it in front of the whole village

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,880
Make you official

6
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:17,470
sister brother-in-law

7
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:28,940
